        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-48_47306_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt">Equity Earnings $ 183,659,615<br />Less: Dividends ($183,659,615)<br />Total 0</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-67_47109_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>The cost-of-service results have been updated to reflect the most current interpretation of the FERC methodology outlined in Opinion No. 154-B, 31 FERC 61,377 (1985), as modified and clarified by subsequent rulings.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-198_47112_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><div><p>Schedule Page 102 Line No.:1 Column: a</p><p><br /></p></div><div class="Section0"><p class="_Normal_"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; text-transform: none; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none">Energy Transfer LP indirectly through affiliates owns approx. 87.7% of Permian Express Partners LLC via the following chain of ownership: </span></p><p class="_Normal_"><span lang="en-US" style="background-color: unset; text-align: inherit; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal">Energy Transfer LP owns 100% ownership of <span style="color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Roboto">ET CC Holdings LLC (DE). ET CC Holdings LLC (DE) </span></span><span lang="en-US" style="background-color: unset; text-align: inherit; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal">owns approx. 87.7% of Permian Express Partners LLC.</span></p><p><span lang="en-US" style="background-color: unset; text-align: inherit; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal"><br /></span></p><p class="_Normal_"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; text-transform: none; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal"><br /></span></p><p style="text-align: left; page-break-inside: auto; page-break-after: auto; page-break-before: avoid; line-height: 107.916664%; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"><span style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt; text-transform: none; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; line-height: 107.916664%"><br /><br /><br /></span></p></div></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-607_47304_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">In accordance with the Order Denying Rehearing, Denying Petition and Granting Remedies in Docket No. RM20-14-004 issued on November 20, 2025 footnote 111, we have determined that rebillings, as permitted in that Order, are not distortive. Accordingly, rebillings in the amount of $5.0 million are included in Account(s) 600.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-772_47305_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt">Equity Earnings $ 149,414,289<br />Less: Dividends ($ 149,414,289)<br />Total 0</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1138_47320_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p><span>Other Adjustments reflect asset reclassification that resulted in changes to the associated depreciation expense.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1242_47363_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>Distribution from Earnings ($ 149,414,289)</p><p>Distribution in Excess of Cumulative Earnings ($ 21,299,876)</p><p>Total ($ 170,714,165) </p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1257_47422_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none">The cost of service results were calculated using the Cost of Service Model.This Model calculates cost of service using the Trended Original Cost methodology promulgated by the FERC in Opinion No. 154-B, 31 FERC 61,377 (1985), as modified and clarified by subsequent rulings. </span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1259_47423_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(73, 80, 87, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none">In accordance with the Order Denying Rehearing, Denying Petition and Granting Remedies in Docket No. RM20-14-004 ("Order") issued on November 20, 2025 footnote 111, we have determined that rebillings, as permited in that Order, are not distortive. Accordingly, rebillings in the amount of $4,922,189 are included in Line 10, Interstate Operating Revenue. These revenues represent a one-time event and are not representative of future revenues.</span><br/></p></link:footnote>
    </link:footnoteLink>
</xbrl>